{"1115990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echo Generation 2", "steam_appid": 1115990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4780510], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echo Generation 2 </strong>is a turn-based sci-fi deckbuilding RPG from the creators of the award-winning Echo Generation (Best Indie Game, Best Narrative, Best Soundtrack).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Echo Generation 2, you step into the past as Jack, the father. What begins as a family vacation spirals into a mystery of hidden experiments, impossible realities, and the truth behind it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Six Playable Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your party from six distinct characters, each with their own abilities, decks, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party of three in the Championships, and discover how characters work together to unlock powerful synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f5b0b49f88233634ede439807330fd5.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f5b0b49f88233634ede439807330fd5.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f5b0b49f88233634ede439807330fd5.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a strategic stance system that rewards planning and timing. Match symbols to break enemy defenses, create openings, and unleash high-impact combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle with deck choices, skill trees, and badge upgrades. Shape each hero to fit your approach and experiment with team compositions to overcome increasing threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f7a021bb8739732d69b58ca2490a771.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f7a021bb8739732d69b58ca2490a771.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f7a021bb8739732d69b58ca2490a771.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Multi-Perspective Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a character-driven narrative told across multiple perspectives.  Each chapter follows different heroes, with distinct tones and worlds, from noir horror to neon-lit cyberpunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As these stories unfold, connections emerge, revealing a larger mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/35531876f9a0966af535ab096190d4be.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/35531876f9a0966af535ab096190d4be.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/35531876f9a0966af535ab096190d4be.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro 3D Pixel Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a richly detailed voxel world, crisp, colorful, and nostalgically crunchy, blending retro charm with modern visual polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Up the Synths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise through the cosmos to an 80s-inspired analog synth soundtrack by Pusher, returning with an all-new interstellar score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"vi